              "text": "बसमध्ये बाळाने दूध ओकलं. basmadhye bāḷāne dūdh oklaṁ. The baby threw up its milk on the bus."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने ओकलं, tyāne oklaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Blunter than उलटी होणे; what comes up is the object."
