          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पचणे — pacṇe — \"to be digested\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रात्रीचं जड जेवण लवकर पचत नाही. rātrīcaṁ jaḍ jevaṇ lavkar pacat nāhī. A heavy dinner does not digest quickly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (to him …): त्याला पचलं, tyālā paclaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The eater takes the dative: मला पचलं. पचवणे, to digest."
            }
          ]
        },
