          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पचणे (pacṇe) is a tadbhava, inherited from Sanskrit pacyate; CDIAL lists Marathi pacṇẽ, \"to be digested\" (CDIAL 7654)."
